@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title Figure 61 — The e•MMC power cycle

concise "VCC" as VCC
concise "VCCQ" as VCCQ

scale 1 as 100 pixels

@0
VCC is "Low"
VCCQ is "Low"

@100
VCC is "Rising"
VCCQ is "Rising"

@200
VCC is "VCC (MIN)"
VCCQ is "VCCQ (MIN)"

@250
VCC is "Above VCC (MIN)"
VCCQ is "Above VCCQ (MIN)"

@400
VCC is "Sleep Mode"
VCCQ is "Sleep Mode"

@500
VCC is "Above VCC (MIN)"
VCCQ is "Above VCCQ (MIN)"

@700
VCC is "Falling"
VCCQ is "Falling"

@800
VCC is "Low"
VCCQ is "Low"

note bottom of VCC
  Command input prohibited | Sleep mode | Command input prohibited
end note

@enduml